# What CI installs for the CLI's tests and for the end to end: the test extras
# of pyproject.toml, and hatchling, its build backend, so that pip builds the
# CLI from the checkout without a download (--no-build-isolation).
# requirements-test.txt locks them and their dependencies with hashes, and CI
# installs only from it. To change a version, edit this file and compile the
# lock again: see CONTRIBUTING.md, "Python lock files".
hatchling
pytest>=7
jsonschema>=4
